  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/itw94Wh.png\" width=\"1982\" height=\"422\"><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/z1o1tp9l9lU?t=23s\" width=\"1080\" height=\"420\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f60\">&nbsp;»<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">戰鬥</a>&nbsp;使用全新&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#f60\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">劍刃</a>&nbsp;直到倒下«<br><br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\">必備模組：&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#fe1900\"><a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords/files/5639538\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords</a>、&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-mod/files/7345468\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight</a>、&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/weapons-of-miracles-epicfight\" rel=\"nofollow\">Weapons of Miracles</a>、<a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-nightfall\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Nightfall</a>、<a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epicfight-resurrection\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Resurrection</a>、<a style=\"color:#fe1900\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-fight-edp/files/7347596\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Fight Extended 資料包</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simplyswords-epicfied-core\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SimplySwords Epicfied Core</a>。</span></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">此資料包為 Epic Fight 與 Simply Swords 提供全面相容性，讓戰鬥更加史詩！</span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:36px;color:#f90\">⁑獨特功能⁑</span></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">每把武器皆有獨特戰鬥風格，意味著超過 100 種不同的動作組合</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">可製作的武器升級路線——從鑽石升級至獄髓，再到符文階級，將強化遊玩風格並增添更多有趣的遊戲體驗<br></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">2.8 更新帶來了 11 種全新自訂固有技能，應用於多種武器！請查看此版本的更新日誌以了解完整列表！每種技能甚至擁有有趣的按鍵組合</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">部分劍類具備雙持或特殊副手武器，或與盾牌搭配的不同風格，快來發現它們吧！:^</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">重新平衡了所有武器的屬性</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">金製物品速度更快且造成更多傷害</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">某些武器在使用右鍵+左鍵（預設）時具有特殊的固有技能互動</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">擁有 23 個由我親自製作的動畫，未來還計劃增加更多</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:24px\">武士刀的「超聚焦」模糊效果、特殊攻擊或技能的「衝擊幀」效果、某些武器在特定模式下的「色彩陰影」效果</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><br>此資料包目前僅與預設 Simply Swords 相容，如果大家喜歡，我將來會嘗試擴展支援<br><span style=\"font-size:36px\">!以下是影片!</span><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/0I_mHaBf6aM?t\" width=\"720\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/QuI1kyeFbAE\" width=\"720\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/J09AwQUbVfI\" width=\"720\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></span></span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/On2qTF7Mnio\" width=\"720\" height=\"360\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"color:#f00\"><del>另外，我真的討厭編碼，對我來說太難了</del><span style=\"color:#000\">…<br>希望你能享受並喜歡這個全球包！</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ol>",
